  "id": "complex-emotion",
  "term": "complex emotion",
  "definition": "A complex emotion is an emotional state such as jealousy, pride, or guilt that develops from combinations of basic emotions together with higher-level cognitive processes. Unlike basic emotions, it is also shaped by personal experience and social context.",
